docs {
  # Subscription Management Tests
  
  Tests for subscription management APIs.
  
  ## What Are Subscriptions?
  
  Subscriptions link consumers to event streams. Each subscription specifies:
  - Subscriber environment ID
  - Queue ID (where events are delivered)
  - Service name (which events to receive)
  - Zone and context
  - Subscription type (EVENT, DELAYED_REQUEST)
  
  ## Tests Included
  
  - Create subscription
  - List subscriptions
  - Get subscription by ID
  - Update subscription
  - Delete subscription
  - Query subscriptions by service/zone/context
  - Error scenarios
  
  ## Important Notes
  
  - Subscriptions require authentication
  - Subscribers must have SUBSCRIBE ACL entries
  - Events are delivered to all matching subscriptions
  - Subscriptions can filter by service, zone, and context
}
